"default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":410064485,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0MTAwNjQ0ODU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/needs%20testing","name":"needs testing","color":"ffcc44","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":12,"created_at":"2026-07-16T00:51:49Z","updated_at":"2026-09-07T18:00:11Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nGodot 4.7.stable\nGodot 4.7.1.stable\n\n### System information\n\nOS: Windows 10 x86_64 Architecture: 64-bit\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen canceling the download of an export template from the Export Template Manager, Godot freezes completely and stops responding.\n\nThis issue occurs with the new individual export template download system introduced in Godot 4.7. When any export template is being downloaded and the user presses the \"Cancel\" button, the download does not simply stop; instead, the entire editor becomes unresponsive.\n\nOn Windows 10, the operating system shows the \"The program has stopped responding\" message, and Godot must be closed manually.\n\nThe expected behavior is that canceling a download should only stop the download process while keeping the editor responsive.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open the Godot Editor.\n2. Open the Export Template Manager.\n3. Start downloading any export template.\n4. While the download is in progress, press the \"Cancel\" button.\n5. Wait for the editor to become unresponsive.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A - The issue occurs in the Godot Editor and does not depend on a project.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121441/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121441/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}